The metro reaches the right station.
I get off the train.
I come outside from the station.
I walk a short distance along the road.
The new terminal can be seen there.
I walk to the terminal.
Inside, there is a large map on the wall.
I stand in front of that map.
I look for the route on the map.
Fort Kochi can be seen on the map.
I find the right stop.
Now I need to board the boat.
